---

This package bundles third-party runtime dependencies and two WebAssembly files
(tree-sitter runtime and tree-sitter-python grammar). Their original licenses are
retained under node_modules in the packaged plugin and in dist/wasm sources; the
packaged SHA256SUMS.txt lists every bundled file.
